  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.11\n        - Date picker: every wheel opens on the chosen value. The scroll target, highlight and snap read each row's laid-out position instead of index x row height (Android's pixel rounding drifted whole rows far down the year column).\n        - The date and time-span pickers open pre-built, no spinner; a drum row is one Label and the year window is +-12 years (it still grows at the edges).\n        - A sheet's open completion can no longer be lost: OpenMotionCompleted is raised the first time an opened sheet comes to rest by any route.\n        - G9Button Size=Hero: 12 above and below the text (was 16), so a Persian descender is no longer cut off.\n\n        Earlier versions: https://github.com/ImanKari/G9MAUIControls/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
